#!name=五组手动分流·域名精简版
#!desc=仅内置日常域名，用于对照排查。先关闭原五组模块；仍需已有五个同名手动策略组。
# Modified by JIAQI23333 on 2026-11-17. GPL-2.0.
# Derived from this repository rules/*.list at d430abed434d1266fc54b3c27f949e25ea456379.
# Upstream authors: blackmatrix7; v2fly/domain-list-community contributors.
# Licenses: ../rules/LICENSE-GPL-2.0 and ../rules/LICENSE-v2fly-MIT.
# All routing rules are inline: no nested RULE-SET downloads or ASN database.
# No IP-only voice routing is provided. Enable only one five-group module.

